    "intro_narrative": "Welcome to the Clockwork Sanctum, the abandoned workshop of the legendary inventor Archimedes Vance. Surrounded by hissing steam pipes, rotating brass gears, and the heavy smell of machine oil and ozone, you have been sent to retrieve his final masterpiece. The workshop is powered by an interconnected web of mechanical logic engines, high-pressure vaults, and aetheric synthesizers. To uncover the sanctum's ultimate secret and escape before the primary boiler pressure reaches critical mass, you must trace the pneumatic tubes connecting the devices and operate his inventions in the precise intended sequence. The Final Verification Engine holds the key to your exit, but it remains locked behind layers of analog cryptography and steam-powered computation. Explore the sprawling lab, deduce the flow of information, and complete Vance's unfinished masterpiece.",
    "narrative_style": "steampunk"
  },
